(What did you try?)

65
00:02:41,170 --> 00:02:42,904
(What did you find?)

66
00:02:42,302 --> 00:02:46,863
What changed your mind?

67
00:02:46,830 --> 00:02:50,653
It loses sets without the net;

68
00:02:52,002 --> 00:02:57,010
Who sees the logs? Not tested yet.

